================================================================================
Context load: stop the Genie Pages Domains lookup from freezing the server
================================================================================

Context:
Opening a Context kept the loading overlay up for ~18-20 s. The load itself
(POST /domain/load-from-uc) takes ~2 s; the overlay waits for /navbar/state
on the next page. Logs showed /navbar/state, /domain/documents/list,
/domain/pages/list, /domain/version-status and /settings/registry all
finishing at the same millisecond after ~18.3 s: the event loop was blocked.
Root cause: PagesManager.init() ran on every /domain/ page load and called
GET /domain/pages/list?include_domains=true. KnowledgePageService.list_domains()
pages through the Databricks Domains API (999 domains = ~10 sequential calls,
measured 15.4 s vs 1.1 s without include_domains) with synchronous `requests`
inside an async route, stalling every concurrent request.

Changes:
1. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-pages.js
   - Pages hydrate lazily: init() only binds events; the new activate()
     (Domains labels, then saved selection) runs on the first
     `sidebarSectionChanged` to "pages", or immediately when the page opens
     on ?section=pages / with the Pages section active.
   - ensureDomains() deduplicates concurrent callers through one in-flight
     promise (_domainsPromise); the fetch moved to _fetchDomains().
2. src/back/core/databricks/KnowledgePageService.py
   - list_domains() memoises results per (host, identity fingerprint) for
     10 minutes (_DOMAINS_CACHE_TTL_S). The fingerprint is a truncated
     SHA-256 of the Authorization header (the token is never stored).
     Only successful fetches are cached; callers get a deep copy.
   - Pagination moved to _fetch_domains(); clear_domains_cache() added.
3. src/api/routers/internal/domain.py
   - GET /domain/pages/list runs its blocking REST calls through
     run_blocking (_knowledge_pages_payload) so it can no longer stall the
     event loop.
4. tests/units/core/test_knowledge_pages.py
   - TestListDomainsCache: cache hit, copy isolation, per-identity keys,
     failures not cached, TTL expiry. Autouse fixture clears the cache.
5. tests/units/api/test_knowledge_pages_route.py (new)
   - Route payload with/without domains, domains failure envelope, and the
     blocking body running through run_blocking.
6. tests/units/front/test_domain_pages_contract.py
   - Contract: Pages hydrate on section change, init() does not fetch
     Domains, in-flight promise dedup.

