1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/certify/__init__.py (new)
   - Package; re-exports `CertifiedBuild`.
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/certify/CertifiedBuild.py (new)
   - `run()`: resolve the target from the domain backend, compose
