================================================================================

Context:
Both graphs are needed, so there is a single Build function: it rebuilds the
Original Graph (gateway VIEW, `..._data` pass-through VIEW, search cache) and,
when that produced triples, the Certified Graph (composition + backend load).
Build on the Original and on the Certified page start the same task. The whole
Build is refused on an IN-REVIEW / PUBLISHED version (D9), and both pages
disable Build with a read-only notice.

